%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 172e1df55f88b8f408f2e07c6708d5d7, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 4707331672703762812
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 698257408
    m_Localized: There you are. Late again, and no coat. It's February, dear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726400
    m_Localized: Ward A is locked, and the keys are on my ring, and my ring is in the kitchen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726401
    m_Localized: I left it on its hook when the lights went. I don't go where the lights go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726402
    m_Localized: Be a love. West end, past the dining hall. A big brass ring. You'll hear it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726403
    m_Localized: And mind the floor. They haven't mopped since the... well. Since.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726404
    m_Localized: The kitchen, dear. West end. A brass ring on a hook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726405
    m_Localized: I'd fetch it myself, but you know how I am about the dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726406
    m_Localized: That's the one. Heavier than I remember.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726407
    m_Localized: Ward A is the long door on the east side. Day room first, then the wing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726408
    m_Localized: Matron says there will be fewer of you each night. I tell her, nonsense. Nonsense, Matron.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726409
    m_Localized: Take the key. Bring it back before the morning count.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726410
    m_Localized: The morning count is at six. You'll be back by six?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726411
    m_Localized: It's always six. It's been six for such a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726412
    m_Localized: Back so soon? Did you wipe your feet?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726413
    m_Localized: Mind the lift. It sticks. It sticks on purpose, I think.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726414
    m_Localized: I counted the beds twice tonight. One of them keeps being one more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726415
    m_Localized: Don't tell Matron. She's very tired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726416
    m_Localized: Don't mention the lamps to Dr. Weiss. He takes it so personally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726417
    m_Localized: Oh, and if you hear someone calling my name, it isn't me. I'm right here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726418
    m_Localized: Salt on the sill. That's what my mother said. Nobody listens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726419
    m_Localized: Don't whistle down here. Just don't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726420
    m_Localized: Boiler room, aye. I've got the key. It's on me somewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726421
    m_Localized: I'm not going down there myself. Not for money. Not for anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726422
    m_Localized: Do me a turn first. Josef's supper. Tray's on the pass. He bites when he's hungry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726423
    m_Localized: He bites?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726424
    m_Localized: Figure of speech. Mostly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726425
    m_Localized: Why don't you take it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726426
    m_Localized: He knows things. About me. About everyone. I'd sooner not be looked at.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726427
    m_Localized: Bedroom, top of the stairs. Take the tray up, then come and see me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726428
    m_Localized: Tray's on the pass, by the stove. Don't let it go cold. He minds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726429
    m_Localized: Go on, then. Don't spill it. Don't look at him too long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726430
    m_Localized: He gave you the key? Huh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726431
    m_Localized: Then I never had it. Funny. I could've sworn it was on my belt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726432
    m_Localized: Boiler room's down in the basement. Lift's the only way. Don't ask me what it's like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726433
    m_Localized: Heard the pipes again. Three knocks, then two. I put my hands over my ears.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726434
    m_Localized: Don't tell Tomas I said so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726435
    m_Localized: The salt's gone off the sill. All of it. Who takes salt?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726436
    m_Localized: I'm staying in the kitchen. The kitchen has a door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726437
    m_Localized: You walk like the new one. They always walk like they were told where the stairs are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726438
    m_Localized: Sit. No, don't sit. That's Elias's bed, and he's particular.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726439
    m_Localized: No tray. Then you're not here for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726440
    m_Localized: Come back with supper. Boiled something, grey, late. I'll know it by the smell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726441
    m_Localized: The tray, boy. The kitchen. Bruno knows where the food is. Bruno always knows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726442
    m_Localized: Cold. Of course it's cold. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726443
    m_Localized: Nobody's brought me anything since the doctor stopped coming. The one who stopped being a doctor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726444
    m_Localized: You'll want the Boiler room. Bruno says he has the key.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726445
    m_Localized: Bruno lies. Poor man, he believes every word of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726446
    m_Localized: Under the pillow. My pillow, you impertinent thing. There.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726447
    m_Localized: Brass, with a tag. I took it off his belt last October. The October.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726448
    m_Localized: Mind the lift. It will stop for you. They always do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726449
    m_Localized: Go on. I'll finish my supper. Cold is how I like it now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726450
    m_Localized: You'll be back. They all come back. It's only a question of how many of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726451
    m_Localized: Elias is up. Standing with his face to the wall, since the lights went.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726452
    m_Localized: Don't speak to him. He thinks it's rude to be answered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726453
    m_Localized: They took Elias down this morning. Drawer five. He'd have wanted a window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726454
    m_Localized: Someone should have told him the drawers have no windows. I'd have done it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726455
    m_Localized: Do you want to see my drawing? It's the house. It has more windows than the real one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726456
    m_Localized: Shh. The chalk is sleeping.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726457
    m_Localized: I had a music box. It was blue on the inside, like water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726458
    m_Localized: I took it down to the long cold hall to show the pipes. They liked it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726459
    m_Localized: Then the lights went away one at a time, and I came upstairs. I forgot it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726460
    m_Localized: Will you fetch it? I'm not allowed down there. The pipes get jealous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726461
    m_Localized: It's on the floor, I think. By the wall. Tell it I'm not cross.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726462
    m_Localized: The long cold hall. By the wall. Tell it I'm not cross.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726463
    m_Localized: You found it! It's still warm. It's always warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726464
    m_Localized: Here. This is for you. I took it from the cold man's coat. He didn't mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726465
    m_Localized: It opens the Morgue. Don't be scared of the Morgue. Everyone is very quiet there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726466
    m_Localized: Thank you. Now you can go and be quiet with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726467
    m_Localized: It's singing in the other room. Can you hear it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726468
    m_Localized: No? Oh. Good. Don't wind it. It winds itself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726469
    m_Localized: I can't hear it any more. I think it went very far away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726470
    m_Localized: Don't go and look. Please. It was only a box.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726471
    m_Localized: Sorry! Sorry. Rounds. I'm late for rounds. Are you on my list?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726472
    m_Localized: No. No, you're not on my list. Good. That's good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726473
    m_Localized: Thank God. Hands. I need hands. Are you steady? You look steady.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726474
    m_Localized: Room 4. The injection. Three ampoules, clear glass, blue cap. I counted them. I count every shift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726475
    m_Localized: I put them down somewhere on this floor. The surgery side, the offices. I don't know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726476
    m_Localized: They roll. They're small. They'll be wherever the light isn't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726477
    m_Localized: Bring all three. I won't give him a short dose. I won't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726478
    m_Localized: '{n} of three. Blue caps, clear glass. Room 4 is waiting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703762812
  - m_Id: 794726479
    m_Localized: He's been waiting such a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726480
    m_Localized: Three. All three. You're a marvel. I could kiss you. I won't. Protocol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726481
    m_Localized: The Surgery key. Here. Take it, take it, I'll need both hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726482
    m_Localized: Room 4. Room four...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726483
    m_Localized: ...it's been empty for years, hasn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726484
    m_Localized: Who was I giving these to?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726485
    m_Localized: Rounds. I should do my rounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726486
    m_Localized: There's always a light on in Room 4. Isn't there? Isn't there always?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726487
    m_Localized: Name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726488
    m_Localized: No. Don't tell me. I have it here somewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726489
    m_Localized: The file's with the Director. The file is always with the Director.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726490
    m_Localized: Name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726491
    m_Localized: Page forty-one. Page forty-one. Page forty-two.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726492
    m_Localized: I have typed this one before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726493
    m_Localized: Don't read over my shoulder. It isn't finished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726494
    m_Localized: You're in here, you know. Page seventeen. Under 'Present'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726495
    m_Localized: It's very good of you to come. It saves me looking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726496
    m_Localized: It's finished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794726497
    m_Localized: It was always going to be finished. I only had to type it out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 4707331672703762812
      type: {class: SmartFormatTag, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
